    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> SUBMITTED : Creator submits
    SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : Brand approves
    APPROVED --> SUBMITTED : Brand undoes approval<br/>(within 5 min, deal still ACCEPTED)
    SUBMITTED --> REVISION_REQUESTED : Brand gives feedback<br/>(only if revisionCount < maxRevisions)
    REVISION_REQUESTED --> SUBMITTED : Creator resubmits
    PENDING --> OVERDUE : Scheduled job (past due date)
    REVISION_REQUESTED --> OVERDUE : Scheduled job
    OVERDUE --> SUBMITTED : Creator submits late
